  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 200°C/180°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato in half.\n• Place potatoes on a lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Arrange cut-side down and roast until crisp and tender, 40-45 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e3862b822813b6e6e5dad6/step-05edb000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic.\n• Roughly chop tomato. Thinly slice spring onion.\n• Drain and rinse chickpeas.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e3862b822813b6e6e5dad6/step-5ad74c10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil and half the garlic over medium-high heat. Cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Transfer to a small heatproof bowl.\n• Add Greek-style yoghurt to garlic oil mixture and stir to combine. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e3862b822813b6e6e5dad6/step-afd9e720.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When potatoes have 5 minutes remaining, return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook chickpeas, chermoula spice blend, tomato paste and remaining garlic and cook, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Stir in the water, brown sugar and butter, until slightly reduced, 1-2 minutes. Lightly crush chickpeas with a fork. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e3862b822813b6e6e5dad6/step-e6029330.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a large bowl, combine golden goddess dressing, mixed salad leaves, tomato and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.\n• ~~~~~~~~~~ MODULAR STEP ~~~~~~~~~~ Meanwhile, in a large bowl, combine golden goddess dressing, mixed salad leaves, tomato and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Crumble over fetta cubes and season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e3862b822813b6e6e5dad6/step-f949a240.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide spuds and garden salad between plates.\n• Top spuds with smashed chermoula chickpeas, spring onion and garlic yoghurt. Crumble over marinated goat cheese to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e3862b822813b6e6e5dad6/step-efc47250.jpeg"
    }
  ]
